<title>PHILIPPINES: TENNIS-PHILIPPINES LEAD INDONESIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PHILIPPINES LEAD INDONESIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines led Indonesia 2-0 after</p>
<p>the opening singles in their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania Zone Group</p>
<p>one tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (Philippine names first)</p>
<p>Robert Angelo beat Suwandi Suwandi 7-6 (10-8) 7-6 (7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>Joseph Lizardo beat Andrian Raturandang 6-4 5-7 7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
